    <!-- Mode -->
    <string name="mjpeg_mode_name">Local mode · MJPEG</string>
    <string name="mjpeg_mode_description">About MJPEG</string>
    <string name="mjpeg_mode_details">Stream the device screen directly to a web browser as JPEG images. Audio is not streamed.\n\n• Works on a local network without internet. Viewers must be able to reach the stream address.\n• PIN protection is optional. When enabled, viewers can enter the PIN or use an access link.\n• The stream uses unencrypted HTTP. Use a trusted network.\n• Network filter offers Wi-Fi, Ethernet, mobile data, VPN, IPv4 and IPv6 options.\n• Adjust image size, JPEG quality and frame rate.\n• Images are sent separately to each viewer, increasing data use.</string>

